#### Fourier Transform and the Cameron-Martin Formula

### Feynman-Kac Formula

With $$V \in C^\infty(M)$$, by the Baker-Campbell-Hausdorff Formula:
```math
e^{it\Delta_M} e^{itV} = e^{it(\Delta_M + V + t/2[\Delta_M,V] + O(t^2))}
```

The Feynman-Kac Formula follows from the path-integral formulation for Brownian Motion.

